save_Backbone_amide_order_parmaeters
   _Saveframe_category          S2_parameters

   _Details                    
;
NMR derived backbone N-H bond vector model-free squared generalized order    
parameters for CaM in complex with CaMKKalphap determined with relaxation data obtained    
at 500 and 750 MHz (1H).
;

   loop_
      _Sample_label

